{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Tracer</strong> puts you in command of an elite spec-ops operative sent on covert missions across the globe \u2014 from war-torn cities to frozen outposts \u2014 to neutralize threats before they ignite global conflict. Every operation demands stealth, precision, and strategy; one mistake can unravel the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced gear, night vision, and suppressed weapons to infiltrate enemy strongholds or go loud with tactical assaults. Every shot counts, every decision matters. <strong>Iron Tracer</strong> delivers grounded, high-stakes combat where planning, patience, and execution define survival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155560?t=1762757228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155560?t=1762757228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155560/9638c96febe9647c8641cffb180c2d076df15c94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762757228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155560/9638c96febe9647c8641cffb180c2d076df15c94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762757228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Swearing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Tracer</strong